，助魏章攻楚，敗楚將屈丐，取漢中地。秦封樗里子，號為嚴君。"}],"rationale":"依前6段明示名字與局部敘事暫接，樗里子名疾與智囊嚴君明示相配。樗裏只取末句人物比擬，不取陰鄉地名；預言天子不補漢代皇帝。惠王、武王、昭王依卒立分辨；未名韓女、蒲守與衛君不補姓名，異母不補惠王母。游騰引古知伯齊桓公不當同期在場者。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p002","text":"秦惠王八年，爵樗里子右更，使將而伐曲沃，盡出其人，取其城，地入秦。秦惠王二十五年，使樗里子為將伐趙，虜趙將軍莊豹，拔藺。明年，助魏章攻楚，敗楚將屈丐，取漢中地。秦封樗里子，號為嚴君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004143","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004142","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004143","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004142","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0051","start":51,"end":56,"surface":"趙將軍莊豹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004145","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"魏章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004146","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0070","start":70,"end":74,"surface":"楚將屈丐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004147","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004142","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m002-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"嚴君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004142","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan","book_id":"b-shiji-071","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-071-chugan"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji